---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="What this journal is for." pubDate={new Date('2026-09-18')}>
	<p>
		This is a public trading journal. Every entry documents a single trade: the thesis behind it,
		how the execution actually went, and what it felt like along the way.
	</p>
	<p>
		The goal is not to show off winners. It is to keep an honest record of decisions so that
		patterns, good and bad, become visible over time.
	</p>
</Layout>
